<title>CHINA: China Jan-Sept heavy oil output down 15.76 percent.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Sept heavy oil output down 15.76 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's heavy oil output totalled 16.37 million tonnes in the first nine months of 1996, down 15.76 percent compared with the same period last year, the State Statistical Bureau said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Heavy oil ouput in September alone was 1.60 million tonnes, the bureau said.</p>
</text>
